## Notable changes this project carries

- Approximately 640 lines of unreachable dead code removed — a full-rebuild XML index path
  stranded after an early `return`; the incremental path is the only implementation.
- The `walkFiles` symlink blind spot fixed: Vortex-style mod installs were invisible to the
  doctor (39 false positives reported; 0 after the fix, DLL count 1 -> 130).
- A `PathSandbox` absolute-path gate added, closing cross-drive and UNC traversal.
- Replaced the upstream default knowledge layer with an in-repo, FTS-indexed `knowledge/`
  corpus; external web docs are now opt-in.
- A Go implementation of the archive under `server-go/`: 117 differential test functions
  (112 parity, 5 registry) and a contract-equivalence check reporting 0 differences against
  the TypeScript tool surface.

## Runtime dependencies

Bun-native (`bun:sqlite`, `bun test`). The rewrite introduced no new runtime dependency.

